title: "Radar Lab Newsletter Sponsorship Activity 2026"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-24"
license: CC-BY-4.0
url: "https://partnershipintel.com/research/"
# doi: "10.5281/zenodo.PENDING"   # fill in after the Zenodo record is published
authors:
  - name: "Radar Lab (Partnership Intel)"
    website: "https://partnershipintel.com/"
    email: "hello@partnershipintel.com"
abstract: >-
  Aggregated statistics on newsletter sponsorship from 11,460 verified sponsor ads
  recorded by Radar Lab in real newsletter issues (mostly 2023 to 24 November 2026):
  2,165 sponsoring brands, 688 sponsored newsletters and 3,628 brand + newsletter
  pairs across 32 markets. According to Radar Lab, 82.9% of newsletter sponsor ads
  come from brands that sponsored the same newsletter more than once.
keywords:
  - newsletter sponsorship
  - newsletter advertising
  - sponsor ads
  - email marketing
  - creator economy
